  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Beside Mu Cha Lang on the black and white mountain is a long bamboo green like jade, named Qing Hao Zi. It is neither human nor variant human. When first shown it floats in the air, casually and peacefully sleeping.",
      "chapters": [
        2155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mu_cha_lang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mu Cha Lang nudges it with branches and says the sage has sent an order. Qing Hao Zi waves from the nudge without landing, then straightens and stays in the air, remarking that they are moving out so quickly. The two leave the mountain leading troops to the front lines.",
      "chapters": [
        2155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "woken-for-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "With Mu Cha Lang it leads armies from Green Lotus Great World into Yellow Earth Great World. It activates Green Life Taker, flying at extreme speed with a green trail and piercing a black-bear Yellow Earth Gu Immortal through the chest, killing it. After the fatal blow it says arrogantly that the Sacred Mountain gave orders and they will all die.",
      "chapters": [
        2156
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "kills-yellow-earth-immortal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_green_lotus_great_world",
        "loc_yellow_earth_great_world",
        "move_green_life_taker",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_black_and_white_sacred_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It kills another Yellow Earth Gu Immortal, takes light injuries, and goes to Mu Cha Lang for healing. After recovering it thanks its old friend, raises its bamboo tail, and vows to try to kill four people, then calls for others to leave some for it. Together with Mu Cha Lang and Old Forest Moss it is one of only three rank eight fighters on Green Lotus’ side among eight total. It has long been rank eight but has never obtained a rank eight Immortal Gu, and in this life has not even seen three. Facing Fang Yuan’s subordinates it shouts that the other side has so many rank eight Immortal Gu and absurdly perfect Immortal Gu sets.",
      "chapters": [
        2157
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "old-friend-on-the-line",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
